---
/** Cropper: a picture dimmed around the box that keeps part of it, its edge white, its corners pearl discs and the thirds inside. */
---

<span class="cover-media" style="display:block; position:relative; width:204px; height:124px; overflow:clip">
  <span class="cover-crop" style="left:44px; top:22px; width:112px; height:78px">
    <i class="cover-crop-dot" style="left:0; top:0"></i>
    <i class="cover-crop-dot" style="left:100%; top:0"></i>
    <i class="cover-crop-dot" style="left:100%; top:100%"></i>
    <i class="cover-crop-dot" style="left:0; top:100%"></i>
  </span>
</span>
